From 4c514197490d6141f0f241dbc2d634a26f1611ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: telegdyd <telegdyd93@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:20:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] jasmine-0136: board guards, early console on the jasmine
 splash, panic/reboot reset

SM6225-only drivers (touch, keys, cpufreq-hw, gauge I2C, MDP/DSI/INTF,
modem) start only when the ADT root is xiaomi,topaz. The bootstrap
console draws at 0x9d400000 (1080x2160). A /sweet-reset ADT node (PS_HOLD,
IMEM restart reason) makes reboot, halt and panic (after panicwait= s)
reset into ABL fastboot.
